  "description": "SDK for LaserSystems Client & Server development using OPC UA. The OPC UA Laser Systems Companion Specification defines a standardized information model for laser processing systems, including cutting, welding, marking, and additive manufacturing applications. It enables seamless integration of laser systems into OPC UA environments by providing a common interface for system configuration, job management, status monitoring, and diagnostics. The model ensures interoperability between laser machines, control systems, and enterprise applications, supporting efficient process control, traceability, and production optimization in high-precision manufacturing.",
